<urn:productium:specification-profile:VerificationEvidenceRecord> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An evidence-attribution record whose constitutive assessment purpose is verification." .
<urn:productium:specification-profile:VerificationEvidenceRecord> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "VerificationEvidenceRecord" .
# 
